# Data Transformation Module
# WASI stdin/stdout filter used by `openapi-cli request --wasm-plugin`.
#
# Reads the response body from stdin and writes a JSON envelope to stdout:
#   Input:  {"hello":"world"}
#   Output: {"wasm":true,"payload":{"hello":"world"}}
#
# Empty stdin -> empty stdout (an empty body is never turned into output).
# Built from transform.wat with: wat2wasm transform.wat -o transform.wasm
